<body lang=EN-US style='word-wrap:break-word'>

    <section class="cms-text-mainblock pd-40 pdb-80 ">
        <div class="container">

            <h2 class="pb-3">FAQs</h2>
            
            <div class="text-box">
                <p><b>Q1: Does it cost anything to list a product online?</b></p>
                <p>A: No, there are absolutely no charges to list your products on BidForSale.com. It is a free online marketplace open to everyone.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="text-box">
                <p><b>Q2: Does BidForSale.com charge a commission?</b></p>
                <p>
                    A: Yes, BidForSale.com charges a commission from sellers only. The specific percentage will be mentioned in the seller's agreement.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="text-box">
                <p><b>Q3: Can I post more than one product?</b></p>
                <p>A: Yes, users can post as many products as they wish.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="text-box">
                <p><b>Q4: How long will my items stay online?</b></p>
                <p>A: Your products will remain online for as long as you choose to keep them there.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="text-box">
                <p><b>Q5: How many photos can I upload for each item?</b></p>
                <p>A: You can upload upto 5 photos for each item.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="text-box">
                <p><b>Q6: Why aren’t my items showing up immediately after I submit them?</b></p>
                <p>A: All items are screened before publication. Once your items are approved, you will receive a notification, and they will go live on the site.</p>
            </div>

            
            <div class="text-box">
                <p><b>Q7: Why would my post be rejected?</b></p>
                <p>A: Posts may be rejected or need correction if they do not comply with our guidelines:

                </p>
                <p>
                    i) Photos must not be copied from other websites.<br>

                    ii) The product should be clearly visible in the photos.<br>

                    ii) Items described inaccurately will be rejected.<br>

                    iv) If your item is refurbished, please specify this clearly.
                </p>
                <p>
                    If a product is rejected, the seller can adjust the post to meet these guidelines and resubmit.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="text-box">
                <p><b>Q8: Do I need to inform BidForSale.com when someone purchases my item or shows interest?</b></p>
                <p>A: No, the transaction process is entirely online. Both seller 
                    and buyer will receive notifications via email about any updates.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="text-box">
                <p><b>Q9: What is Product Bidding/Negotiation?</b></p>
                <p>A: BidForSale.com allows sellers to label their item prices as negotiable, 
                    which enables buyers to place bids. Sellers have the option to accept or reject these bids.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="text-box">
                <p><b>Q10: Will I receive a tax invoice when I buy a product?</b></p>
                <p>
                    A: Yes, buyers will receive a tax invoice for any purchases made.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="text-box">
                <p><b>Q11: Is Cash on Delivery available?</b></p>
                <p>
                    A: Yes, Cash on Delivery (COD) is available, along with online payment options.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="text-box">
                <p><b>Q12: What is BFS?</b></p>
                <p>
                    A: BFS (BidForSale) is a dedicated marketplace for luxury products, 
                    available to both individual and corporate users. It features an exclusive 
                    selection of items on both the website and app. BFS is an e-commerce 
                    platform that includes all necessary features to conduct successful 
                    online transactions, including a direct payment gateway to sellers' 
                    bank accounts upon order completion.

                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="text-box">
                <p><b>Q13: How can I trust that I will get paid after sending my item?</b></p>
                <p>
                    A: Payment is guaranteed based on the provided details. An email confirmation 
                    will be sent after the order is successfully completed. We are committed 
                    to providing a risk-free selling experience and aim to become the largest 
                    e-commerce portal in India through customer satisfaction.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="text-box">
                <p><b>Q14: Does Bid For Sale have a customer care number?</b></p>
                <p>
                    A: Yes, Bid For Sale offers a dedicated customer service number that users 
                    can call directly.
                </p>
            </div>



        </div>
    </section>



</body>
